{"title":"Career Roadmap: Nutritionist","role":"Nutritionist","summary":"A Nutritionist applies knowledge of nutrition, food science, human biology, and health to help individuals, communities, institutions, or organizations make informed food and nutrition decisions.","facts":{},"about":[],"intro":[],"horizons":[],"sections":[{"heading":"Overview","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Career Path"},{"type":"table","header":["Level","Category","Degree","Specialization","Target Career","Career Cluster","Typical Duration","Primary Goal"],"rows":[[{"text":"UG"},{"text":"Science"},{"text":"B.Sc (Bachelor of Science – General / Honours)"},{"text":"Home Science"},{"text":"Nutritionist"},{"text":"Nutrition, Food & Wellness"},{"text":"3–4 years"},{"text":"Build foundations in nutrition, food science, health, diet planning, and community nutrition"}],[{"text":"PG"},{"text":"Science / Health"},{"text":"M.Sc / M.Sc (Hons.)"},{"text":"Nutrition / Food & Nutrition / Applied Nutrition / Public Health Nutrition"},{"text":"Nutritionist / Nutrition Specialist"},{"text":"Nutrition & Health"},{"text":"2 years"},{"text":"Develop advanced nutrition knowledge and professional specialization"}],[{"text":"Advanced"},{"text":"Health / Research"},{"text":"Ph.D."},{"text":"Nutrition / Nutritional Sciences / Public Health / Food Science"},{"text":"Nutrition Researcher / Academic / Specialist"},{"text":"Research & Higher Education"},{"text":"3–6+ years"},{"text":"Conduct research, teach, or specialize in advanced nutrition science"}]]},{"type":"h","text":"Career Roadmap Overview"},{"type":"p","text":"A Nutritionist applies knowledge of nutrition, food science, human biology, and health to help individuals, communities, institutions, or organizations make informed food and nutrition decisions."},{"type":"p","text":"For a student entering through B.Sc Home Science, the strongest pathway is:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Home Science","Nutrition & Food Science","Nutrition Assessment","Diet Pla